             GridBox[{{
                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"astro-ph/0209016\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"K. S. Cheng\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"C.Y. Ng, K.S. Cheng, M.C. Chu\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Cooling Properties of Cloudy Bag Strange Stars\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"23 pages, 14 figures, accepted by Astroparticle Physics, \
abstract\\n  appeared here has been shortened\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Astropart.Phys.19:171-192,2003\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"10.1016/S0927-6505(02)00197-4\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"astro-ph\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  As the chiral symmetry is widely recognized as an \
important driver of the\\nstrong interaction dynamics, current strange stars \
models based on MIT bag\\nmodels do not obey such symmetry. We investigate \
properties of bare strange\\nstars using the Cloudy Bag Model, in which a \
pion cloud coupled to the\\nquark-confining bag is introduced such that \
chiral symmetry is conserved. We\\nfind that in this model the decay of pions \
is a very efficient cooling way. In\\nfact it can carry out most the thermal \
energy in a few milliseconds and\\ndirectly convert them into 100MeV photons \
via pion decay. This may be a very\\nefficient $\\\\gamma$-ray burst \
mechanism. Furthermore, the cooling behavior may\\nprovide a possible way to \
distinguish a compact object between a neutron star,\\nMIT strange star and \
Cloudy Bag strange star in observations.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Mon, 2 Sep 2002 08:03:23 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
               
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2008-11-26\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
