           TagBox[
            TagBox[
             GridBox[{{
                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"gr-qc/9608034\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"S. Droz\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", "\"S. Droz\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Numerical investigation of black hole interiors\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"6 pages LaTeX, 3 eps figures\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Phys. Rev. D 55, 3575 (1997)\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1103/PhysRevD.55.3575\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Alberta-THY 22-96\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"gr-qc\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Gravitational perturbations which are present in any \
realistic stellar\\ncollapse to a black hole, die off in the exterior of the \
hole, but experience\\nan infinite blueshift in the interior. This is \
believed to lead to a slowly\\ncontracting lightlike scalar curvature \
singularity, characterized by a\\ndivergence of the hole's (quasi-local) mass \
function along the inner horizon.\\n  The region near the inner horizon is \
described to great accuracy by a plane\\nwave spacetime. While Einstein's \
equations for this metric are still too\\ncomplicated to be solved in closed \
form it is relatively simple to integrate\\nthem numerically.\\n  We find for \
generic regular initial data the predicted mass inflation type\\nnull \
singularity, rather than a spacelike singularity. It thus seems that \
mass\\ninflation indeed represents a generic self-consistent picture of the \
black hole\\ninterior.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Wed, 14 Aug 1996 19:13:29 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2016-08-24\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Droz\"", ",", "\"S.\"", ",", "\"\""}], "}"}], 
