topological\\n  insulators\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "\"7 pages, 3 figures\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Phys. Rev. Lett. 106, 077003 (2011)\""}]}, {
                
