Kawasaki, Y. Tokura,\\n  and F. Kagawa\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Topological stability versus thermal agitation in a \
metastable magnetic\\n  skyrmion lattice\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"23 pages, 8 figures (including Supplementary \
Information), revised\\n  version is accepted in Nat. Phys\""}]}, {
                
