                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  A review of the random magnetic impurity model, \
introduced in the context of\\nthe integer Quantum Hall effect, is presented. \
It models an electron moving in\\na plane and coupled to random Aharonov-Bohm \
vortices carrying a fraction of the\\nquantum of flux. Recent results on its \
perturbative expansion are given. In\\nparticular, some funny families of \
integrals show up to be related to the\\nRiemann $\\\\zeta(3)$ and \
$\\\\zeta(2)$.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
