Laurent Besacier, Matthias\\n  Gall\\\\'e\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Multilingual Unsupervised Neural Machine Translation \
with Denoising\\n  Adapters\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Accepted as a long paper to EMNLP 2021\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
