\n  Frederic Sala", "title" -> 
             "The Cost of Compression: Investigating the Impact of \
Compression on\n  Parametric Knowledge in Language Models", "comments" -> 
             "Accepted to EMNLP 2023 Findings", "journal-ref" -> Null, "doi" -> 
             Null, "report-no" -> Null, "categories" -> "cs.CL cs.AI cs.LG", 
