validation across diverse model sizes and data scales\ndemonstrates Opt-Laws' \
ability to accurately predict training loss and identify\noptimal LR schedule \
candidates in pre-training, continual training, and\nfine-tuning scenarios. \
This approach significantly reduces computational costs\nwhile enhancing \
overall model performance.\n", 
