Cherian Kurian,\\n  and Amit Sethi\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Improving Mitosis Detection Via UNet-based Adversarial \
Domain\\n  Homogenizer\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"cs.CV\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  The effective localization of mitosis is a critical \
precursory task for\\ndeciding tumor prognosis and grade. Automated mitosis \
detection through deep\\nlearning-oriented image analysis often fails on \
unseen patient data due to\\ninherent domain biases. This paper proposes a \
domain homogenizer for mitosis\\ndetection that attempts to alleviate domain \
differences in histology images via\\nadversarial reconstruction of input \
images. The proposed homogenizer is based\\non a U-Net architecture and can \
effectively reduce domain differences commonly\\nseen with histology imaging \
data. We demonstrate our domain homogenizer's\\neffectiveness by observing \
the reduction in domain differences between the\\npreprocessed images. Using \
this homogenizer, along with a subsequent retina-net\\nobject detector, we \
were able to outperform the baselines of the 2021 MIDOG\\nchallenge in terms \
of average precision of the detected mitotic figures.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Thu, 15 Sep 2022 11:15:57 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], "}"}]}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2022-09-20\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    
