            TagBox[
             GridBox[{{
                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2207.05473\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Alberto Testolin Dr.\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Matteo Zambra, Alberto Testolin, Marco Zorzi\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"A developmental approach for training deep belief \
networks\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Cognitive Computation, 2022\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/s12559-022-10085-5\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"cs.LG cs.NE\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Deep belief networks (DBNs) are stochastic neural \
networks that can extract\\nrich internal representations of the environment \
from the sensory data. DBNs\\nhad a catalytic effect in triggering the deep \
learning revolution,\\ndemonstrating for the very first time the feasibility \
of unsupervised learning\\nin networks with many layers of hidden neurons. \
These hierarchical\\narchitectures incorporate plausible biological and \
cognitive properties, making\\nthem particularly appealing as computational \
models of human perception and\\ncognition. However, learning in DBNs is \
usually carried out in a greedy,\\nlayer-wise fashion, which does not allow \
to simulate the holistic maturation of\\ncortical circuits and prevents from \
modeling cognitive development. Here we\\npresent iDBN, an iterative learning \
algorithm for DBNs that allows to jointly\\nupdate the connection weights \
across all layers of the model. We evaluate the\\nproposed iterative \
algorithm on two different sets of visual stimuli, measuring\\nthe generative \
capabilities of the learned model and its potential to support\\nsupervised \
downstream tasks. We also track network development in terms of\\ngraph \
theoretical properties and investigate the potential extension of iDBN \
to\\ncontinual learning scenarios. DBNs trained using our iterative approach \
achieve\\na final performance comparable to that of the greedy counterparts, \
at the same\\ntime allowing to accurately analyze the gradual development of \
internal\\nrepresentations in the deep network and the progressive \
improvement in task\\nperformance. Our work paves the way to the use of iDBN \
for modeling\\nneurocognitive development.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 12 Jul 2022 11:37:58 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v2\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Tue, 2 Aug 2022 14:10:14 GMT\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
                    "}"}]}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"update_date\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2024-02-08\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"authors_parsed\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Zambra\"", ",", "\"Matteo\"", ",", "\"\""}], 
                    "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"\"Testolin\"", ",", "\"Alberto\"", ",", "\"\""}],
                     "}"}], ",", 
