                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"2103.13655\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Tizian Wenzel\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Tizian Wenzel, Marius Kurz, Andrea Beck, Gabriele \
Santin, Bernard\\n  Haasdonk\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Structured Deep Kernel Networks for Data-Driven Closure \
Terms of\\n  Turbulent Flows\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1007/978-3-030-97549-4_47\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"cs.LG cs.NA math.NA\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\""}]}\
, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  Standard kernel methods for machine learning usually \
struggle when dealing\\nwith large datasets. We review a recently introduced \
Structured Deep Kernel\\nNetwork (SDKN) approach that is capable of dealing \
with high-dimensional and\\nhuge datasets - and enjoys typical standard \
machine learning approximation\\nproperties. We extend the SDKN to combine it \
with standard machine learning\\nmodules and compare it with Neural Networks \
on the scientific challenge of\\ndata-driven prediction of closure terms of \
turbulent flows. We show\\nexperimentally that the SDKNs are capable of \
dealing with large datasets and\\nachieve near-perfect accuracy on the given \
application.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
