                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Chikun Ding, Yu Shi, Jun Chen, Yuebing Zhou and \
Changqing Liu\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"High dimensional AdS-like black hole and Phase \
transition in\\n  Einstein-bumblebee gravity\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"19 pages,four figures, 1 table\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Chin. Phys. C 47 045102 (2023)\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", "\"10.1088/1674-1137/aca8f4\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"gr-qc hep-th\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"license\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  In this paper we obtain an exact high dimensional \
anti-de Sitter (AdS) black\\nhole solution in Einstein-bumblebee gravity \
theory. This AdS-like black hole\\ncan only exist with a linear functional \
potential of the bumblebee field. We\\nfind that the Smarr formula and the \
first law of black hole thermodynamics can\\nstill be constructed in this \
Lorentz symmetry breaking black hole spacetime as\\nlong as its temperature, \
entropy and volume are slightly modified. We find also\\nthat there exist two \
kinds of phase transition: small-large black hole phase\\ntransition and \
Hawking-Page phase transition, like those of Schwarzschild AdS\\nblack hole. \
After Lorentz symmetry breaking, the black hole mass at divergent\\npoint of \
heat capacity becomes small, and the Gibbs free energy of the\\nmeta-stable \
large black hole is also smaller, showing that the large stable\\nblack hole \
can be more easily formed.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
