             "  In this paper we obtain an exact high dimensional anti-de \
Sitter (AdS) black\nhole solution in Einstein-bumblebee gravity theory. This \
AdS-like black hole\ncan only exist with a linear functional potential of the \
bumblebee field. We\nfind that the Smarr formula and the first law of black \
hole thermodynamics can\nstill be constructed in this Lorentz symmetry \
breaking black hole spacetime as\nlong as its temperature, entropy and volume \
are slightly modified. We find also\nthat there exist two kinds of phase \
transition: small-large black hole phase\ntransition and Hawking-Page phase \
transition, like those of Schwarzschild AdS\nblack hole. After Lorentz \
symmetry breaking, the black hole mass at divergent\npoint of heat capacity \
becomes small, and the Gibbs free energy of the\nmeta-stable large black hole \
is also smaller, showing that the large stable\nblack hole can be more easily \
