, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We present a novel dark energy candidate, based upon \
the existence and\\ndynamics of Ghost D-branes in a warped compactification \
of type IIB string\\ntheory. Gp-branes cancel the combined BPS sectors of the \
Dp-branes, while they\\npreserve the same supersymmetries. We show that this \
scenario can naturally\\nlead to either quintessence or phantom-like \
behaviors, depending on the form of\\nthe involved potentials and brane \
tension.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
