                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  A new procedure of the linear position measurement \
which allows to obtain\\nsensitivity better than the Standard Quantum Limit \
and close to the Energetic\\nQuantum Limit is proposed and analyzed in \
details. Proposed method is based on\\nthe principles of stroboscopic quantum \
measurement and variation quantum\\nmeasurement and allows to avoid main \
disadvantages of both these procedures.\\nThis method can be considered as a \
good candidate for use as a local position\\nmeter in the ``intracavity'' \
topologies of the laser gravitational-wave\\nantennae.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
