             "  MadGraph5_aMC@NLO is a software package that allows one to \
simulate processes\nof arbitrary complexity, at both the leading and the \
next-to-leading order\nperturbative accuracy, with or without matching and \
multi-jet merging to parton\nshowers. It has been designed for, and so far \
primarily employed in the context\nof, hadronic collisions. In this note, we \
document the implementation of a few\ntechnical features that are necessary \
to extend its scope to realistic ee\ncollider environments. We limit \
