heavy mesons\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"27 pages, 7 figures, 6 tables, version to appear in \
Phys. Rev. D.\\n  arXiv admin note: substantial text overlap with \
arXiv:1003.0972,\\n  arXiv:0906.4412\""}]}, {
                
