                RowBox[{"\"id\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph/0210429\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"submitter\"", "\[Rule]", "\"Einan Gardi\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"authors\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"E. Gardi and R.G. Roberts\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"title\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"The interplay between Sudakov resummation, renormalons \
and higher twist\\n  in deep inelastic scattering\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"comments\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"32 pages, 12 post-script figures\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"journal-ref\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"Nucl.Phys. B653 (2003) 227-255\""}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"doi\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"10.1016/S0550-3213(03)00035-X\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"report-no\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We claim that factorization implies that the evolution \
kernel, defined by the\\nlogarithmic derivative of the N-th moment of the \
structure function d ln F_2^N\\n/ d ln Q^2, receives logarithmically enhanced \
contributions (Sudakov logs) from\\na single source, namely the constrained \
invariant mass of the jet. Available\\nresults from fixed-order calculations \
facilitate Sudakov resummation up to the\\nnext-to-next-to-leading \
logarithmic accuracy. We use additional all-order\\ninformation on the \
physical kernel from the large-beta_0 limit to model the\\nbehaviour of \
further subleading logs and explore the uncertainty in extracting\\nalpha_s \
and in determining the magnitude of higher-twist contributions from \
a\\ncomparison with data on high moments.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
