                  "\"CLNS 97/1500, TECHNION-PH 97-06\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"categories\"", "\[Rule]", "\"hep-ph\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"license\"", "\[Rule]", "Null"}]}, {
                
                RowBox[{
                 "\"abstract\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  "\"  We derive consistency conditions which constrain the \
possible form of the\\nstrong couplings of the excited baryons to the pions. \
The consistency\\nconditions follow from requiring the pion-excited baryon \
scattering amplitudes\\nto satisfy the large-N_c Witten counting rules and \
are analogous to consistency\\nconditions used by Dashen, Jenkins and Manohar \
and others for s-wave baryons.\\nThe consistency conditions are explicitly \
solved, giving the most general\\nallowed form of the strong vertices for \
excited baryons in the large-N_c limit.\\nWe show that the solutions to the \
large-N_c consistency conditions coincide\\nwith the predictions of the \
nonrelativistic quark model for these states,\\nextending the results \
previously obtained for the s-wave baryons. The 1/N_c\\ncorrections to these \
predictions are studied in the quark model with arbitrary\\nnumber of colors \
N_c.\\n\""}]}, {
                RowBox[{"\"versions\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"version\"", "\[Rule]", "\"v1\""}], ",", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"created\"", "\[Rule]", 
                    "\"Sun, 27 Jul 1997 17:50:05 GMT\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
