             Null, "abstract" -> 
             "  We discuss in detail how to consistently impose boundary \
conditions in\nquantum string cosmology. Since a classical time parameter is \
absent in quantum\ngravity, such conditions must be imposed with respect to \
intrinsic variables.\nConstructing wave packets for minisuperspace models \
from different tree-level\nstring effective actions, we explain in particular \
the meaning of a transition\nbetween ``pre-big-bang\" and ``post-big-bang\" \
branches. This leads to a scenario\ndifferent from previous considerations.\n\
", "versions" -> {{
               "version" -> "v1", "created" -> 
                "Thu, 9 Jan 1997 14:03:23 GMT"}, {
               "version" -> "v2", "created" -> 
                "Fri, 10 Jan 1997 18:00:09 GMT"}}, "update_date" -> 
             "2009-10-30", 
             "authors_parsed" -> {{"Dabrowski", "Mariusz P.", ""}, {
               "Kiefer", "Claus", ""}}}], "Tooltip"]& ], InsetBox[
